  "description": "In-process transformer inference via ONNX Runtime: embeddings (a bi-encoder with the model's own pooling) or reranking (a cross-encoder over query/document pairs) — no server, no port. References the MANAGED half only — the consuming app adds one native backend (Microsoft.ML.OnnxRuntime for CPU, .DirectML for any DX12 GPU, .Gpu for CUDA), so the library never picks the user's hardware. Wired via builder.AddOnnxProvider(modelDirectory).",
